{"4349210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goo Deer", "steam_appid": 4349210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goo Deer</strong> is a dark first-person gas station management game set in a foggy world addicted to one strange drink. Keep the shelves stocked, serve the customers, grow the business, and survive what waits beyond the pumps.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/caa16eb2b6bb0a11858625397dec814b.poster.avif?t=1787587483\" aria-label=\"A line of Goo Deer customers waiting at the gas station counter.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/caa16eb2b6bb0a11858625397dec814b.webm?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/caa16eb2b6bb0a11858625397dec814b.mp4?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Night Shift</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and sell different Goo Deer flavors, manage inventory, serve the growing line of customers, and hire employees to keep the station moving.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/471de2c31fb043c23d50504185cc86a9.poster.avif?t=1787587483\" aria-label=\"Shelves of Goo Deer product and the station&#039;s crafting equipment.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/471de2c31fb043c23d50504185cc86a9.webm?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/471de2c31fb043c23d50504185cc86a9.mp4?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the Goo Deer Flowing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance resources, staff, and production as demand rises. Expand the station without letting an empty shelf or a bad decision bring the shift to a halt.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/f01d1822a7ec8e0430e5794bd3cee74d.poster.avif?t=1787587483\" aria-label=\"The player hunting for ingredients in the dark foggy forest.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/f01d1822a7ec8e0430e5794bd3cee74d.webm?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/f01d1822a7ec8e0430e5794bd3cee74d.mp4?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Fog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ingredients are outside. Leave the safety of the station, hunt deer in the misty forest, and avoid the dangerous creature moving through the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the station. Feed the town. Survive the fog.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goo Deer</strong> is a dark first-person gas station management game set in a foggy world addicted to one strange drink. Keep the shelves stocked, serve the customers, grow the business, and survive what waits beyond the pumps.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/caa16eb2b6bb0a11858625397dec814b.poster.avif?t=1787587483\" aria-label=\"A line of Goo Deer customers waiting at the gas station counter.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/caa16eb2b6bb0a11858625397dec814b.webm?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/caa16eb2b6bb0a11858625397dec814b.mp4?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Night Shift</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and sell different Goo Deer flavors, manage inventory, serve the growing line of customers, and hire employees to keep the station moving.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/471de2c31fb043c23d50504185cc86a9.poster.avif?t=1787587483\" aria-label=\"Shelves of Goo Deer product and the station&#039;s crafting equipment.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/471de2c31fb043c23d50504185cc86a9.webm?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/471de2c31fb043c23d50504185cc86a9.mp4?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the Goo Deer Flowing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance resources, staff, and production as demand rises. Expand the station without letting an empty shelf or a bad decision bring the shift to a halt.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/f01d1822a7ec8e0430e5794bd3cee74d.poster.avif?t=1787587483\" aria-label=\"The player hunting for ingredients in the dark foggy forest.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349210/extras/f01d1822a7ec8e0430e5794bd3cee74d.webm?t=1787587483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour